+## Board Publication
+
+A board can be published to generate a secret public link that anyone can use to view the board, its columns, and its published cards, without signing in.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board and returns its `public_url`. Only board administrators can publish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board, invalidating its `public_url`. Only board administrators can unpublish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+Public boards are also available at `/public/boards/:key`, with columns and published cards at `/public/boards/:key/columns/:id` and `/public/boards/:key/cards/:number` respectively.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
